        "zh": {
          "title": "西南航空洛杉磯飛奧蘭多航班　三組搖滾樂團輪番機上演出",
          "summary": "Hoobastank、Simple Plan與The Used在西南航空航班演出，班機於全美暫停起飛前離地。",
          "body": [
            "Simple Flying報導，Hoobastank、Simple Plan與The Used於11月13日在西南航空由洛杉磯飛往奧蘭多的航班上輪流演出，旅客拍攝的客艙影片隨後在社群平台流傳。三組樂團均預定參與奧蘭多的Vans Warped Tour活動。",
            "報導指出，該航班在美國聯邦航空總署發布全美暫停起飛指令前離地。西南航空是活動合作夥伴，旗下Live at 35計畫安排機上音樂演出；Simple Flying表示，截稿前未取得航空公司針對這班飛機的回應。"
          ]
        },
        "en": {
          "title": "Three rock bands perform aboard Southwest flight to Orlando",
          "summary": "Hoobastank, Simple Plan and The Used played aboard a Southwest flight that departed before the nationwide ground stop.",
          "body": [
            "Hoobastank, Simple Plan and The Used performed aboard a Southwest Airlines flight from Los Angeles to Orlando on November 13, Simple Flying reported. Passenger videos of the cabin performances circulated on social media. All three bands were due to appear at Vans Warped Tour in Orlando.",
            "The report says the aircraft departed before the FAA nationwide ground stop. Southwest is a festival partner and runs the Live at 35 inflight music program. Simple Flying said it had not received a Southwest response about this particular flight before publication."
          ]
        },
